data: {"id": "2f9b54eab6a24694-thinking-parallel_evidence-895", "run_id": "2f9b54eab6a24694", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 状态与配置\n- Pod `aiops-case-v11/workload` UID: `f99c513d-bc63-43ba-bc90-111cd5958ce7`，调度到 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.26`。\n- 当前 `phase=Pending`，`Ready=False`，容器 `app` 状态 `Waiting`，`Reason=CreateContainerConfigError`。\n- 事件（最近 10-12 分钟，重复 12 次）：`Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input`。\n- YAML 确认：容器 `app` 的 `message` 字段与事件一致——`couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input`。\n\n### Prometheus Metrics\n- `kube_po", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789146013546, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

